  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.9&nbsp;is now generally available. This release uses&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-1.22.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kubernetes 1.22</a>&nbsp;with CRI-O runtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about what new at the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.9/release_notes/ocp-4-9-release-notes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Red Hat OpenShift 4.9 release notes</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/openshift/support-lifecycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.9 is now generally available. This release uses Kubernetes 1.22 with CRI-O runtime.\n\nLearn more about what new at the Red Hat OpenShift 4.9 release notes .\n\nLearn more about the Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule ."
  },
